WEBVTT

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.220
We're going too fast.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:34.970
You're not going to kill me and make it look like an accident,

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.100
like what happened to a certain princess, are you?

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:41.600
It's so you won't be sniped.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:44.350
Don't talk so much.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:46.520
It makes me want to forget my job and kill you.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:51.780
I never asked for FBI protection, you know.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:13.260
What's wrong?

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:14.220
We're under attack.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:16.050
Somebody shot out our tires!

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:17.300
Turn back!

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:22.810
Damn, do something!

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:24.140
You're the FBI right?

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:25.940
This is the car carrying Gabole.

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:28.810
We're under attack on Route 29, point D!

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:44.580
Abandon the car.

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:46.960
This car is completely bulletproof.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:48.830
We're safest in here!

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:51.090
If they set fire to it we're done for!

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:55.800
The gas is everywhere outside, so they can't see us to shoot us.

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:09.980
Don't stop!

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.830
How much are they paying you?

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.800
I'll give you twice, no, three times as much!

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:08.220
I held my breath and kept waiting while my heart was scratched away

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:19.570
A minute, a second never felt so long

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:31.330
I look up at the sky and ask the wind, "Can I fly now?"

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:37.630
The weak person I was is no more

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:43.220
I decided to just believe

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:50.350
With the dreams I once had in my hand now

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:54.190
I go towards you

00:04:56.100 --> 00:05:01.900
Carrying those emotions I felt when I broke

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:06.030
I go towards you

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:10.080
Blown by the wind

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:15.540
Oh blown

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:22.130
The Target Who Came Back

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:27.510
A drug lord was shot on his way to the FBI?

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:28.300
Why?

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:29.970
Probably to keep him from talking.

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.720
Keep him from talking?

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.180
Even though he's the boss?

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:35.980
You don't need to be that surprised.

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:39.940
In this age, even the President could be assassinated.

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:40.980
That's true, but...

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:43.360
The police who were escorting him were killed too.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:47.110
To be killed while guarding a Mafia boss...

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:49.660
I feel bad for the families.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:06:00.130
The boss made a plea bargain: the FBI drops the charges and he tells them everything he knows.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:05.090
If that happens what would become of us, the ones left behind?

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:09.010
We've done all kinds of illegal things on his orders.

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:12.010
Take a look.

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:18.520
The reward is 3 million dollars.

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:20.400
You can have the girl as a tip.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.060
I can guarantee the taste.

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.860
I don't need the tip.

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:28.320
Let's hear the details.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.280
You're no fun.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:40.120
The flight will be arriving at Hong Kong International Airport as scheduled.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:44.800
The weather in Hong Kong is clear today, with a temperature of eighteen degrees.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:43.770
Wait, Gol-

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:45.360
No, Mr. Tougou.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:48.110
We just came to get you.

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:50.610
Why didn't the one who called me come?

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:53.160
Don't get mad.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:55.870
Lately, the boss hasn't had any desire to appear in public.

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:02.670
Mr. Tougou, why did you hit Johnny back there?

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:04.920
He stood behind me.

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:16.680
Thank you for coming, Mr. Golgo 13.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:18.890
Do you like the Hong Kong night skyline?

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:25.020
I heard you were an A+ class assassin.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:28.900
I assume your avoidance of small talk is to keep your feelings from wavering.

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:35.660
I called you here to eliminate someone.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:41.000
Where do you think you're going?

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:45.210
I've never taken a job from a voice.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:48.170
I'm neither a phone nor a recording.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:49.960
I'm right in front of you.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:54.050
Very well.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:58.760
Jake, open the curtains.

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:28.540
You don't seem surprised.

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:32.340
Or is that the pokerface unique to Asians?

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:38.720
The man you shot yesterday was named "Spike Jordan."

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:40.760
He was a small-time thug from Chicago.

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:47.060
A bit of facial plastic surgery and he looked just like me.

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:54.530
You probably guessed, but this was a trick to avoid the FBI.

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:59.870
The man who came up with this idea, the man you met in Miami, was Rocky Brown.

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:08.290
Look, Mr. Golgo 13, at this beautiful skyline.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:12.090
Truly the pearl of Asia.

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:16.630
Did you call me here to have me enjoy the view?

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:19.840
The target will arrive in Hong Kong tomorrow.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:22.300
It's Rocky Brown.

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:27.770
It's good to have a reliable man,
but it's bad when he's too reliable.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:28.310
I refuse.

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:30.810
Why?

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:35.610
I make a point not to have two clients at the same time.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:38.570
Your work should have been finished.

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:42.580
Rocky Brown's request was the death of Bugsy Big Gabole.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:48.620
I see.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:55.800
Until you receive a sufficient explanation from Rocky Brown, I am still your target?

00:10:56.590 --> 00:11:01.390
Thank you for showing me the skyline, Mr. Bugsy Big Gabole.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:12.980
We'll have no choice but to eliminate him, it seems.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:28.290
Hey, hey, let's play.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.670
Hey, come on...

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:07.620
Mr. Tougou, a phone call from Rocky.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.330
Talk to him directly.

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:08.110
Golgo... 13!

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:09.490
Golgo... 13!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.040
What do you think you're doing?

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.160
Work.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:16.500
Work?

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:17.410
Who hired you?

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:20.710
Bugsy Big Gabole.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:21.790
The boss?

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.300
The boss hired you to eliminate me?

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:26.670
Why?

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:33.220
How the hell does the boss plan on rebuilding the syndicate without me?

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:39.440
Which means you did intend to have me shoot a fake Bugsy.

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:42.770
It was a trick!

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:44.440
To fool the FBI!

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:47.950
We were going to tell you later!

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:49.780
Believe me!

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:52.450
I didn't mean to trick you!

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:02.330
"Intended to?"

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:17.100
Hey, when are you going to take me to America?

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:18.850
Soon.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:23.360
Once Golgo 13 and Rocky Brown are dealt with and things calm down.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.030
Excuse me.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:32.870
Your gun.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:36.370
I'm Rocky Brown.

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:40.370
Did your boss tell you to point a gun at me, too?

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.250
It's the rules.

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:45.170
If you don't like it, complain to the boss directly.

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:49.510
I'm going to remember your face.

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:54.220
Boss, Rocky Brown is here.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:57.890
Let him in.

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:00.390
Wait in the bedroom.

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:13.490
I can't believe you, boss.

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:16.910
You used to only drink Bourbon, now you drink wine?

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:19.160
It's expensive, put it back.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:24.710
It wouldn't surprise me if you were after my life too, the way things are looking.

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:34.470
You...

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.430
You're not the boss are you?

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.850
Spike Jordan.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:43.270
Why are you here?

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:46.060
You had the boss shot.

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:48.400
The fool.

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:50.940
To think he'd be killed by his best friend.

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:54.950
You'll be found out right away!

00:16:54.950 --> 00:17:00.240
If I kill you, nobody will know my true identity.

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:04.790
I even changed my voice, so I need to make the best use I can out of it.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:10.550
A small-time Chicago thug like you can't run the syndicate!

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:13.420
You'll be murdered in your sleep within a month.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:15.970
And there's one more thing you have to worry about.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:19.600
That Asian?

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:21.470
He's dead already.

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:25.020
I sent Jake and Johnny after him.

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:26.730
And have you heard from them?

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:29.360
Of course you haven't.

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:33.990
I just met him.

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:35.490
What?

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:41.370
That's what he meant by "intended?"

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:43.040
What are you talking about?

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:47.500
He knew you were a fake.

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:52.050
He sent me here to confirm it.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:57.930
And he just confirmed you were the fake.

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.260
He will come.

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:06.520
He'll come here to kill you.

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:20.620
I have skilled young cubs at the entrance 24/7.

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:23.330
The windows are special bulletproof glass.

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:27.960
Let him try.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:34.210
Hurry!

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:54.480
With the guard this thick, maybe he'll just give up?

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:55.730
I hope so.

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:57.740
Roof east side.

00:18:57.740 --> 00:18:58.490
Nothing unusual.

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:01.490
This is the first floor, south side corridor, nothing.

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:03.700
Stairwell B, floor 24.

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:04.450
Nothing.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:06.620
Roof west side.

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:07.830
Nothing unusual.

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:10.330
Stairwell A, floor 4, nothing.

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:14.960
This is the B4 parking lot, nothing out of the ordinary.

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:17.920
You won't look?

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.470
I know the answer.

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:22.840
The identities of the two bodies found at the Wan Chai pier were-

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:26.220
Cool and refreshing: Fresh Juice! New and on sale!

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:28.020
This is the first floor elevator area.

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:28.980
Nothing.

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:30.770
A stairwell, 19th floor.

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:31.980
Nothing out of the ordinary.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:33.900
What about the B stairwell?

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:36.150
This is floor 24. Nothing.

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:42.950
Hey.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:46.830
What's going on with the roof camera?

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:47.990
There's no one there.

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:51.500
There was somebody there a second ago...

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.000
He's on the roof.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.500
The roof!

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.500
Get to the roof!

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:07.680
Where is he?

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.150
We have a possible intruder!

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:16.980
The only place to hide on the roof is the air conditioning room.

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:20.530
He's trapped like a rat.

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:56.350
What smells like almonds?

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:59.360
It can't be cyanide gas...

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:06.700
Send the guys from upstairs!

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:07.820
Take out Golgo!

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:08.950
Head in!

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:46.820
Cease fire!

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:03.880
Find Golgo's body.

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:05.050
Yes sir.

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:13.680
It was just an almond-scented spray?

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:18.940
This is the air conditioning room.

00:22:18.940 --> 00:22:20.520
We can't find Golgo.

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:22.650
Hello?

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:24.150
Hello?

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:25.070
Hey!

00:22:25.070 --> 00:22:27.030
Somebody answer me!

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:49.590
Chiisana koto ni zenryoku ni naru kimi no sugata yuuki ni natta hibi

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:49.590
Those days I saw you giving your all for small things filled me with courage

00:22:49.590 --> 00:22:57.060
Zutto horyuu shippanashi jya ugokenai

00:22:49.590 --> 00:22:57.060
If I keep them suspended then I won't be able to move

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:06.610
GARASU no HAIWEI ni tatteiru you ni

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:06.610
It's like I'm standing on a glass highway

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:13.830
Yume to kiken to senaka awase demo

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:13.830
Even if I'm standing back to back with dreams and danger

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:20.960
Kono nagai michi wo sukoshizutsu arukou

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:20.960
I'll take this long road one step at a time

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:27.130
Soshite kimi wa ano koro mitai ni

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:27.130
And I need you to smile

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:30.130
Waratteite

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:30.130
Like you did back then

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:36.770
Shiokaze ni yurete sasayakiatta

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:36.770
It shook in the sea breeze and whispered

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:47.360
Kagayaiteita tooi ano hi wa kagerou

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:47.360
That distant and shining day is a shimmering haze

00:23:45.820 --> 00:23:49.240
The shining days

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:55.200
Tsumaranai koto ni makeru ni wa hayasugiru

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:55.200
I can't lose to something so trivial

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:07.500
The young genius sniper Katz takes a job from the State Department:

00:24:08.210 --> 00:24:13.680
Eliminate Golgo 13 when he arrives at the airport.

00:24:14.430 --> 00:24:18.010
A plan with every detail thought out awaits Golgo.

00:24:18.010 --> 00:24:19.980
Next time on Golgo 13:

00:24:20.980 --> 00:24:22.440
Dead Angle.

00:24:20.980 --> 00:24:26.560
Dead Angle

00:24:23.140 --> 00:24:26.730
Don't stand behind him, if you value your life.
